          "type": "text",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "h1",
              "text": "FOSSIL STONE COLLECTION"
            },
            {
              "tag": "h2",
              "text": "Albero x En Gold"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "We welcome En Gold, an Australian brand born out of a love for craftsmanship and cultural heritage. Through a shared philosophy for design, we at Albero bring to the spotlight the art of Fossil Stone Furniture, a traditional handcrafted skill close to En Gold Founder Steffanie Ball."
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "The Miro and Estrella collections rethink and redefine the possibilities of handcrafted limestone pieces in home decor. Complemented by the curves of each piece, they set a new standard for originality and minimalism."
            }
          ]
        },
