        {
          "type": "image-classic",
          "image": "/images/engold/IMG_0050_5.jpg",
          "alt": "",
          "caption": "the Art of Fossil Furniture The art of Fossil Stone Furniture is a traditional handcrafted skill unique to the islands in the Philippines. Every step of the process is handmade, and each piece is perfectly imperfect. This is the beauty of this craft and perfection should never be expected, the beauty is found in the uneven surface, small organic holes and pits, slightly unaligned joints. This tells the story of the hands that crafted each and every piece.",
          "link": null
